{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ludion-ai/ludion/pulls/162","id":5049168588,"node_id":"PR_kwDOU_btN88AAAABLPQyzA","html_url":"https://github.com/Ludion-ai/ludion/pull/162","diff_url":"https://github.com/Ludion-ai/ludion/pull/162.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Ludion-ai/ludion/pull/162.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ludion-ai/ludion/issues/162","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ludion-ai/ludion/pulls/162/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ludion-ai/ludion/pulls/162/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ludion-ai/ludion/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ludion-ai/ludion/issues/162/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ludion-ai/ludion/statuses/eedb106d75331a390ef8ade0d2e0b20c74d729da","number":162,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"build(deps): bump astro from 7.3.6 to 7.4.2","user":{"login":"dependabot[bot]","id":49699333,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDk2OTkzMzM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/29110?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/dependabot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Bumps [astro](https://github.com/withastro/astro/tree/HEAD/packages/astro) from 7.3.6 to 7.4.2.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/releases\">astro's releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>astro@7.4.2</h2>\n<h3>Patch Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/18430\">#18430</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/dda9ec395c89a1420abb3b8f88b5c7f1f385f82e\"><code>dda9ec3</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/Abhirup-99\"><code>@​Abhirup-99</code></a>! - Speeds up content sync with <code>experimental.collectionStorage: &quot;chunked&quot;</code> by computing each character's UTF-8 width from its code point instead of encoding every character through <code>TextEncoder</code>. On a store of ~44k entries this cuts the chunking step from about 60 seconds to well under a second, with byte-identical output.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/18438\">#18438</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/5e0eaa4415a9081efdaeb3d9af3717ce3226ad18\"><code>5e0eaa4</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/apps/astro-factory\"><code>@​astro-factory</code></a>! - Fixes <code>astro dev</code> with <code>@astrojs/cloudflare</code> failing with <code>Calling `require` for &quot;node-fetch&quot;</code> when a server dependency such as <code>cross-fetch</code> requires <code>node-fetch</code></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/18376\">#18376</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/a4e201d79f19caa6bf4222f42167aeb602c066e6\"><code>a4e201d</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/okxint\"><code>@​okxint</code></a>! - Fixes <code>astro dev</code> treating a stale lock file containing a Linux thread ID as a running Astro server. A successful process lookup with no matching PID now marks the lock as stale, preventing <code>astro dev stop</code> and <code>astro dev --force</code> from killing the unrelated process that owns the thread.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/18467\">#18467</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/d1fb7d36dad440c57d62b071e752ae220cca2baa\"><code>d1fb7d3</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/apps/astro-factory\"><code>@​astro-factory</code></a>! - Fixes the <code>defineConfig()</code> types for <code>i18n.defaultLocale</code>, <code>i18n.fallback</code>, and <code>i18n.domains</code> so they accept a custom locale's <code>path</code> instead of its <code>codes</code>, matching how Astro validates and uses these values</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/18475\">#18475</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/cf27e70a9057ce29ade2a8a843bd9275a696e9ab\"><code>cf27e70</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/ematipico\"><code>@​ematipico</code></a>! - Bumps the minimum supported Node.js version to 22.23.4, which includes the fixes from the <a href=\"https://nodejs.org/en/blog/vulnerability/october-2026-security-releases\">October 2026 Node.js security releases</a></p>\n<p>This is a patch release because the <a href=\"https://docs.astro.build/en/upgrade-astro/#nodejs-support-and-upgrade-policies\">Node.js support and upgrade policy</a> allows the Core team to raise the minimum Maintenance LTS version in a patch release when a disclosed and fixed Node.js security flaw affects Astro.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/18451\">#18451</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/7a0ba6f48ebae256a1ce49de4f1c62c009ff94e2\"><code>7a0ba6f</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/DenisCDev\"><code>@​DenisCDev</code></a>! - Fixes <code>astro sync</code>, <code>astro check</code> and <code>astro build</code> replacing the optimized dependencies of a dev server running in the same project, which broke framework islands in that dev server until it was restarted with <code>--force</code></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/18336\">#18336</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/e943003259c3bb4d528d3d49c8ccd3eb8f84b8b5\"><code>e943003</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/apps/astro-factory\"><code>@​astro-factory</code></a>! - Fixes inline styles in dev so that framework-transformed CSS is used, such as scoped styles and <code>v-bind()</code> in Vue single-file components</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/18399\">#18399</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/829fc00629ef715fc606b89c6e684ca93f9253b9\"><code>829fc00</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/apps/astro-factory\"><code>@​astro-factory</code></a>! - Fixes a dev server error (<code>Could not find server component name</code>) for a <code>server:defer</code> island that imports <code>astro:actions</code> or <code>astro:config/server</code>, when its page was not the first island page loaded after starting the server</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/18330\">#18330</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/4db9e0d1e6a54c2300b96a0ff0cfaf5c188cecda\"><code>4db9e0d</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/Samuteg\"><code>@​Samuteg</code></a>! - Fixes the <code>astro:env/server</code> virtual module being generated with invalid JS in dev when any environment variable contains <code>$</code> replacement patterns (<code>$`</code>, <code>$&amp;</code>, <code>$'</code>, <code>$1</code>, …). The inlined env JSON was passed as a string to <code>String.replace</code>, so e.g. the <code>KITTY_PUBLIC_KEY</code> value set by default in Kitty terminals corrupted the module and broke dev with <code>Failed to parse source for import analysis</code></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Updated dependencies [<a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/cf27e70a9057ce29ade2a8a843bd9275a696e9ab\"><code>cf27e70</code></a>]:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>@​astrojs/telemetry</code><a href=\"https://github.com/3\"><code>@​3</code></a>.4.1</li>\n<li><code>@​astrojs/markdown-satteri</code><a href=\"https://github.com/0\"><code>@​0</code></a>.4.5</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>astro@7.4.1</h2>\n<h3>Patch Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/18425\">#18425</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/6fdc36ed97316d932d2e143b85739f0af37ab329\"><code>6fdc36e</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/apps/astro-factory\"><code>@​astro-factory</code></a>! - Preserves the last modified date of cached optimized images and incrementally restored build output when copying them into the build output on all platforms</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/18419\">#18419</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/395d19525986a276bf81af7bd365e7a35dc20ef3\"><code>395d195</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/apps/astro-factory\"><code>@​astro-factory</code></a>! - Fixes a typo in the error message shown when a font <code>cssVariable</code> is invalid</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/18401\">#18401</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/484822fbba652745c4f2da5ef434a350203578e2\"><code>484822f</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/danielmlr\"><code>@​danielmlr</code></a>! - Fixes a bug where projects whose path contains an apostrophe (<code>'</code>) failed to load sessions, middleware, a cache provider, or a <code>src/fetch.ts</code> handler</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/18407\">#18407</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/a6e00beae6c134d0c1b5248eb02fbf119b7d64e9\"><code>a6e00be</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/apps/astro-factory\"><code>@​astro-factory</code></a>! - Fixes a <code>TSCONFIG_ERROR</code> during <code>astro build</code> when a parent directory contains a <code>tsconfig.json</code> that cannot be resolved, such as one extending <code>astro/tsconfigs/strict</code> without installed dependencies</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/18427\">#18427</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/908f1672a9fe6c40e6b73bfb0307f0d1f3ac2057\"><code>908f167</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/apps/astro-factory\"><code>@​astro-factory</code></a>! - Fixes an <code>Unterminated string</code> build error when application code imports from <code>astro/config</code> (for example, <code>fontProviders</code> in a shared fonts module)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/18428\">#18428</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/40e7d54c7f969b402f011d32ccd87123835d0aa1\"><code>40e7d54</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/apps/astro-factory\"><code>@​astro-factory</code></a>! - Fixes missing styles in production builds for conditionally rendered framework components (e.g. Svelte components inside <code>{#if}</code> blocks) imported by a hydrated island</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/18424\">#18424</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/617ff59820b4a5777eb5d3765c09d29082b11acc\"><code>617ff59</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/apps/astro-factory\"><code>@​astro-factory</code></a>! - Fixes style-only HMR in <code>.astro</code> components falling back to a full page reload when a PostCSS plugin (such as <code>@unocss/postcss</code>) lists the component as a dependency of its own style</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/18274\">#18274</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/70834bbea43695c563358ea055d32ecb5e0a78dd\"><code>70834bb</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/Princesseuh\"><code>@​Princesseuh</code></a>! - Fixes increasing memory usage when editing the Astro configuration while the dev server is running</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>astro@7.4.0</h2>\n<h3>Minor Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/17894\">#17894</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/b7a1bd99ac7c68cf36078058f15f1bd1fab4cbe8\"><code>b7a1bd9</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/Princesseuh\"><code>@​Princesseuh</code></a>! - Adds a new <code>--timings</code> flag to <code>astro build</code> to help you find what slows down your builds</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/blob/main/packages/astro/CHANGELOG.md\">astro's changelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>7.4.2</h2>\n<h3>Patch Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/18430\">#18430</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/dda9ec395c89a1420abb3b8f88b5c7f1f385f82e\"><code>dda9ec3</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/Abhirup-99\"><code>@​Abhirup-99</code></a>! - Speeds up content sync with <code>experimental.collectionStorage: &quot;chunked&quot;</code> by computing each character's UTF-8 width from its code point instead of encoding every character through <code>TextEncoder</code>. On a store of ~44k entries this cuts the chunking step from about 60 seconds to well under a second, with byte-identical output.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/18438\">#18438</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/5e0eaa4415a9081efdaeb3d9af3717ce3226ad18\"><code>5e0eaa4</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/apps/astro-factory\"><code>@​astro-factory</code></a>! - Fixes <code>astro dev</code> with <code>@astrojs/cloudflare</code> failing with <code>Calling `require` for &quot;node-fetch&quot;</code> when a server dependency such as <code>cross-fetch</code> requires <code>node-fetch</code></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/18376\">#18376</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/a4e201d79f19caa6bf4222f42167aeb602c066e6\"><code>a4e201d</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/okxint\"><code>@​okxint</code></a>! - Fixes <code>astro dev</code> treating a stale lock file containing a Linux thread ID as a running Astro server. A successful process lookup with no matching PID now marks the lock as stale, preventing <code>astro dev stop</code> and <code>astro dev --force</code> from killing the unrelated process that owns the thread.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/18467\">#18467</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/d1fb7d36dad440c57d62b071e752ae220cca2baa\"><code>d1fb7d3</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/apps/astro-factory\"><code>@​astro-factory</code></a>! - Fixes the <code>defineConfig()</code> types for <code>i18n.defaultLocale</code>, <code>i18n.fallback</code>, and <code>i18n.domains</code> so they accept a custom locale's <code>path</code> instead of its <code>codes</code>, matching how Astro validates and uses these values</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/18475\">#18475</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/cf27e70a9057ce29ade2a8a843bd9275a696e9ab\"><code>cf27e70</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/ematipico\"><code>@​ematipico</code></a>! - Bumps the minimum supported Node.js version to 22.23.4, which includes the fixes from the <a href=\"https://nodejs.org/en/blog/vulnerability/october-2026-security-releases\">October 2026 Node.js security releases</a></p>\n<p>This is a patch release because the <a href=\"https://docs.astro.build/en/upgrade-astro/#nodejs-support-and-upgrade-policies\">Node.js support and upgrade policy</a> allows the Core team to raise the minimum Maintenance LTS version in a patch release when a disclosed and fixed Node.js security flaw affects Astro.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/18451\">#18451</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/7a0ba6f48ebae256a1ce49de4f1c62c009ff94e2\"><code>7a0ba6f</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/DenisCDev\"><code>@​DenisCDev</code></a>! - Fixes <code>astro sync</code>, <code>astro check</code> and <code>astro build</code> replacing the optimized dependencies of a dev server running in the same project, which broke framework islands in that dev server until it was restarted with <code>--force</code></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/18336\">#18336</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/e943003259c3bb4d528d3d49c8ccd3eb8f84b8b5\"><code>e943003</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/apps/astro-factory\"><code>@​astro-factory</code></a>! - Fixes inline styles in dev so that framework-transformed CSS is used, such as scoped styles and <code>v-bind()</code> in Vue single-file components</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/18399\">#18399</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/829fc00629ef715fc606b89c6e684ca93f9253b9\"><code>829fc00</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/apps/astro-factory\"><code>@​astro-factory</code></a>! - Fixes a dev server error (<code>Could not find server component name</code>) for a <code>server:defer</code> island that imports <code>astro:actions</code> or <code>astro:config/server</code>, when its page was not the first island page loaded after starting the server</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/18330\">#18330</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/4db9e0d1e6a54c2300b96a0ff0cfaf5c188cecda\"><code>4db9e0d</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/Samuteg\"><code>@​Samuteg</code></a>! - Fixes the <code>astro:env/server</code> virtual module being generated with invalid JS in dev when any environment variable contains <code>$</code> replacement patterns (<code>$`</code>, <code>$&amp;</code>, <code>$'</code>, <code>$1</code>, …). The inlined env JSON was passed as a string to <code>String.replace</code>, so e.g. the <code>KITTY_PUBLIC_KEY</code> value set by default in Kitty terminals corrupted the module and broke dev with <code>Failed to parse source for import analysis</code></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Updated dependencies [<a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/cf27e70a9057ce29ade2a8a843bd9275a696e9ab\"><code>cf27e70</code></a>]:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>@​astrojs/telemetry</code><a href=\"https://github.com/3\"><code>@​3</code></a>.4.1</li>\n<li><code>@​astrojs/markdown-satteri</code><a href=\"https://github.com/0\"><code>@​0</code></a>.4.5</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>7.4.1</h2>\n<h3>Patch Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/18425\">#18425</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/6fdc36ed97316d932d2e143b85739f0af37ab329\"><code>6fdc36e</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/apps/astro-factory\"><code>@​astro-factory</code></a>! - Preserves the last modified date of cached optimized images and incrementally restored build output when copying them into the build output on all platforms</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/18419\">#18419</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/395d19525986a276bf81af7bd365e7a35dc20ef3\"><code>395d195</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/apps/astro-factory\"><code>@​astro-factory</code></a>! - Fixes a typo in the error message shown when a font <code>cssVariable</code> is invalid</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/18401\">#18401</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/484822fbba652745c4f2da5ef434a350203578e2\"><code>484822f</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/danielmlr\"><code>@​danielmlr</code></a>! - Fixes a bug where projects whose path contains an apostrophe (<code>'</code>) failed to load sessions, middleware, a cache provider, or a <code>src/fetch.ts</code> handler</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/18407\">#18407</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/a6e00beae6c134d0c1b5248eb02fbf119b7d64e9\"><code>a6e00be</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/apps/astro-factory\"><code>@​astro-factory</code></a>! - Fixes a <code>TSCONFIG_ERROR</code> during <code>astro build</code> when a parent directory contains a <code>tsconfig.json</code> that cannot be resolved, such as one extending <code>astro/tsconfigs/strict</code> without installed dependencies</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/18427\">#18427</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/908f1672a9fe6c40e6b73bfb0307f0d1f3ac2057\"><code>908f167</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/apps/astro-factory\"><code>@​astro-factory</code></a>! - Fixes an <code>Unterminated string</code> build error when application code imports from <code>astro/config</code> (for example, <code>fontProviders</code> in a shared fonts module)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/18428\">#18428</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/40e7d54c7f969b402f011d32ccd87123835d0aa1\"><code>40e7d54</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/apps/astro-factory\"><code>@​astro-factory</code></a>! - Fixes missing styles in production builds for conditionally rendered framework components (e.g. Svelte components inside <code>{#if}</code> blocks) imported by a hydrated island</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/18424\">#18424</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/617ff59820b4a5777eb5d3765c09d29082b11acc\"><code>617ff59</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/apps/astro-factory\"><code>@​astro-factory</code></a>! - Fixes style-only HMR in <code>.astro</code> components falling back to a full page reload when a PostCSS plugin (such as <code>@unocss/postcss</code>) lists the component as a dependency of its own style</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/18274\">#18274</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/70834bbea43695c563358ea055d32ecb5e0a78dd\"><code>70834bb</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/Princesseuh\"><code>@​Princesseuh</code></a>! - Fixes increasing memory usage when editing the Astro configuration while the dev server is running</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>7.4.0</h2>\n<h3>Minor Changes</h3>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/34c953555749223022e6bb2f02019d3515749a24\"><code>34c9535</code></a> [ci] release (<a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/tree/HEAD/packages/astro/issues/18459\">#18459</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/cf27e70a9057ce29ade2a8a843bd9275a696e9ab\"><code>cf27e70</code></a> fix: minimal support node version (<a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/tree/HEAD/packages/astro/issues/18475\">#18475</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/1efb9d60e59ba7081f28e1f99d557468a5ea48eb\"><code>1efb9d6</code></a> Update dependency <code>@​playwright/test</code> to v1.64.1 (<a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/tree/HEAD/packages/astro/issues/18441\">#18441</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/5e0eaa4415a9081efdaeb3d9af3717ce3226ad18\"><code>5e0eaa4</code></a> fix(astro): stop excluding node-fetch from server dep optimization in workerd...</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/a4e201d79f19caa6bf4222f42167aeb602c066e6\"><code>a4e201d</code></a> fix(dev): treat missing ps row as stale in lockfile process check (<a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/tree/HEAD/packages/astro/issues/18376\">#18376</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/7a0ba6f48ebae256a1ce49de4f1c62c009ff94e2\"><code>7a0ba6f</code></a> Use a separate Vite cache for the temporary sync server (<a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/tree/HEAD/packages/astro/issues/18451\">#18451</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/d1fb7d36dad440c57d62b071e752ae220cca2baa\"><code>d1fb7d3</code></a> fix(i18n): use locale path instead of codes in defineConfig i18n types (<a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/tree/HEAD/packages/astro/issues/18467\">#18467</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/dda9ec395c89a1420abb3b8f88b5c7f1f385f82e\"><code>dda9ec3</code></a> fix(content): compute UTF-8 width arithmetically in getChunkEnd (<a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/tree/HEAD/packages/astro/issues/18430\">#18430</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/7af66fc785d85b1df1f98e7123a52b2306250985\"><code>7af66fc</code></a> Fix astro-check binary silently dropping the first two CLI arguments (<a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/tree/HEAD/packages/astro/issues/18455\">#18455</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/829fc00629ef715fc606b89c6e684ca93f9253b9\"><code>829fc00</code></a> Skip server island manifest in CSS ensureModulesLoaded to fix late-discovery ...</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commits/astro@7.4.2/packages/astro\">compare view</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n","labels":[{"id":12867753632,"node_id":"LA_kwDOU_btN88AAAAC_vpWoA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ludion-ai/ludion/label